§§ `After the first update day: the fee that must be paid in full is the updated one`

-- 1.1.2026: a practical exam costs 196 (194 x 1.0125 = 196.425).  194 is no longer in full; 196 is.
#ASSERT NOT `regulation 4 does not bar the service in the vintage` vM `the service of sitting a practical exam` 194 (YMD 2026 1 1) (`the illustrative readings`)
#ASSERT `regulation 4 does not bar the service in the vintage` vM `the service of sitting a practical exam` 196 (YMD 2026 1 1) (`the illustrative readings`)
